# Prettier only reads the .gitignore next to it, so build output that a nested
# .gitignore already covers still has to be named here. Formatting any of it
# would last until the next build.

# tsc output for the functions package (frontend/functions/.gitignore)
functions/lib

# rewritten by `nuxt build` via the apphosting nitro preset
.apphosting

.firebase
.claude
CLAUDE.md
# Blog posts are MDC, not plain markdown: prettier reads the YAML block inside
# `::chart` / `::stats` as a list and a horizontal rule, and rewrites it into
# something MDC parses differently - a chart's `unit` ended up inside its
# series. tests/content/blogPosts.test.ts checks these files instead.
content/blog
